<title>USA: ICO Inc sells $120 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>ICO Inc sells $120 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high yield 144A debt issue from ICO Inc was priced on Wednesday via Bear Stearns &amp; Co, according to a market source.</p>
<p>Houston, Texas-based ICO is engaged in the petrochemicals processing, oil services inspection and protective coatings sectors.</p>
<p>BORROWER ICO INC</p>
<p>AMT $120 MLN	COUPON 10-3/8 PCT MATURITY 6/01/07</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES    ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1   YIELD 10-3/8 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS   SPREAD 374.5BP    CALLABLE FIVE YEAR</p>
<p>							   MAKE-WHOLE</p>
<p>							   AT TREASURY +75BP</p>
<p>NOTE:3-year equity call for 35 percent at 110.375</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
